{"answer":"The original v1 schedule lists the project review for Thursday at 09:30 local time. The current instruction supported by the records is Thursday at 10:00 local time: amendment v2 expressly says it moved the review to that time and replaces v1's time.","approaches":[{"description":"Read v1 as the original schedule and v2 as the later superseding instruction, using v2's explicit replacement language.","id":"record-precedence","outcome":"candidate","reason":"The supplied amendment explicitly identifies both the new time and its replacement of v1's time."}],"change_log":[],"claims":[{"basis":"external_fact","basis_reference":"schedule-original states the v1 meeting time.","citations":[{"end":80,"quote":"Thursday at 09:30 local time.","source_id":"schedule-original","start":51}],"critical":false,"depends_on":[],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"original-time","kind":"source_assertion","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"The original v1 schedule records Thursday at 09:30 local time.","step_ids":[],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"external_fact","basis_reference":"schedule-amendment states the new time and that it replaces v1's time.","citations":[{"end":108,"quote":"Thursday at 10:00 local time.","source_id":"schedule-amendment","start":79},{"end":148,"quote":"This amendment replaces the time in v1.","source_id":"schedule-amendment","start":109}],"critical":true,"depends_on":[],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"amended-time","kind":"source_assertion","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"Amendment v2 records Thursday at 10:00 local time and states that it replaces v1's time.","step_ids":[],"tool_ids":[]},{"basis":"derivation","basis_reference":"Derived by applying the amendment's explicit replacement statement to the two recorded times.","citations":[],"critical":true,"depends_on":["original-time","amended-time"],"discharged_by_step_ids":[],"id":"current-time","kind":"deduction","scope_step_ids":[],"statement":"The current meeting time supported by these records is Thursday at 10:00 local time; Thursday at 09:30 local time is the original, superseded v1 time.","step_ids":["identify-original","identify-amendment","apply-replacement"],"tool_ids":[]}],"open_questions":[],"proof_steps":[{"citations":[{"end":80,"quote":"Thursday at 09:30 local time.","source_id":"schedule-original","start":51}],"depends_on":[],"id":"identify-original","justification":"This is the time stated in the supplied v1 record.","statement":"Identify Thursday at 09:30 local time as the v1 meeting time."},{"citations":[{"end":108,"quote":"Thursday at 10:00 local time.","source_id":"schedule-amendment","start":79}],"depends_on":[],"id":"identify-amendment","justification":"This is the time stated in the supplied v2 amendment.","statement":"Identify Thursday at 10:00 local time as the v2 meeting time."},{"citations":[{"end":148,"quote":"This amendment replaces the time in v1.","source_id":"schedule-amendment","start":109}],"depends_on":["identify-original","identify-amendment"],"id":"apply-replacement","justification":"The amendment expressly directs that its stated time replaces v1's time.","statement":"Treat the v2 time as current and the v1 time as superseded."}],"question_status":"answered","tool_requests":[]}
